'''Farfetch'd''' (Japanese: '''カモネギ''' ''Kamonegi'') is a {{ct|Colorless}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

