==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Neo Revelation|Farfetch'd|43}} from the {{TCG|Neo Revelation}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Hidden Fates|Farfetch'd|45}} from the {{TCG|Hidden Fates}} expansion.
**Both this card and the Hidden Fates print have the '''Leek Slap''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|Base Set|Farfetch'd|27}} from the {{TCG|Base Set}}.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Farfetch'd}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

